2026-08-09T03:22:27.0699482Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-08-09T03:22:27.0700151Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-08-09T03:22:27.0700639Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
